title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/protest.jpg
go-to: main_rally; sa_disrupt if sa_strength > 180 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy

@sa_disrupt

The Nazi SA has disrupted our rally! Their street troops are preventing us from meeting.

- @police_protect: Call the police to protect our rally.
- @rfb_protect: Use the RFB to protect our rally.
- @both_protect: The police and Roter Frontkampferbund should work together to protect our rally.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.

@police_protect
view-if: spd_prussia == 1 and spd_relation >= 70
on-arrival: police_protect_success = prussian_police_loyalty * prussian_police_militancy * prussian_police_strength*2 - sa_militancy*sa_strength;
go-to: police_protect_win if police_protect_success >= 0; police_protect_lose if police_protect_success < 0

@police_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The police successfully protected our rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

@police_protect_lose
on-arrival: strife += 1; workers_nsdap += 3

Unfortunately, the police were unable or unwilling to hold back the SA mob. The Nazis have won this show of strength.

@rfb_protect
on-arrival: rfb_success = rfb_strength*rfb_militancy - sa_strength*sa_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rfb_protect_win if rfb_success >= 0; rfb_protect_lose if rfb_success < 0

@rfb_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Roter Frontkampferbund has successfully protected our rally against the SA! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@rfb_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_nsdap += 3; rb_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the Roter Frontkampferbund was not able to hold back the SA mob. The Nazis have won this show of strength.

@both_protect
view-if: spd_prussia
choose-if: spd_relations > 70
unavailable-subtitle: The SPD is not willing to order its police to protect us.
on-arrival: rb_success = rfb_strength*rfb_militancy - sa_strength*sa_militancy + prussian_police_loyalty*prussian_police_militancy*prussian_police_strength*2; strife += 1
go-to: both_protect_win if rfb_success >= 0; both_protect_lose if rfb_success < 0

@both_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The police and RFB have successfully protected our rally against the SA! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@both_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_nsdap += 3; rfb_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the police and RFB were not able to hold back the SA mob. The Nazis have won this show of strength.


@cancel
on-arrival: workers_nsdap += 3;

The SA have won this show of strength.

@main_rally

Mass rallies of the workers are a display of our strength, and provide us a direct opportunity to speak to the masses all at once. What will the theme of this rally be?

- @revolution: Capitalism is collapsing, while we seek to grasp the moment, the social fascists claim to be its savior.
- @united_front: The masses of workers, united, will lead the fight against fascism and capitalism.
- @labor_front: The unions, councils, and toiling masses will be the center of a socialist future, regardless of affiliation. 
- @pacifism: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
- @wtb: Support the WTB plan!
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@revolution
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 4*(1-dissent) if pro_republic < 40; workers_kpd += 4*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 70; workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if pro_republic < 40 and socialism >= 60; unemployed_kpd += 4*(1-dissent) if thalmannites_strength > labor_wing_strength; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_spd += 5*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; thalmannites_strength += 5; thalmannites_dissent -= 5; old_middle_kpd -= 4; new_middle_kpd -= 3; spd_relation -= 5; z_relation -= 8; socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); pro_republic -= 2*(1 - dissent) 

Our message of revolution is expected, but it appeals to the left wing of the working class, while surely alienating the middle class and other parties. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]

@united_front
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 4*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 60; unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 60; conciliators_strength += 5; labor_wing_strength += 3; conciliators_dissent -= 3; labor_wing_dissent -= 3; spd_relation += 5; z_relation += 2; united_front_support += 2; popular_front_support += 1; socialism += 2*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)

The conciliatory rhetoric is unexpected, but welcomed by the left and some centrists within the SPD. Our message of working class unity against the forces of reaction Grassroots support for a united front against fascism is growing among the rank-and-file of both parties, even the middle-class.

@labor_front
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 50; unemployed_kpd += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 6*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 50; new_middle_spd += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if socialism >= 50; socialism += 2*(1-dissent); adgb_strength += 5

Our speakers center their focus on the unions and laboring masses, speaking on issues that matter to the average worker, and call for a massive increase in union organization and representation in the party. The workers and unions in kind flock are receptive to the message.

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_kpd += 4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; new_middle_kpd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3

Our speakers denounce the military establishment and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
on-arrival: wtb_support += 1; workers_spd += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 6*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent);

The WTB plan has become a popular rallying cry for our party. The workers are eager to go back to work, and that is exactly what the plan promises.


@local
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_kpd += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the workers in this moment.
